{
  "format": 1,
  "name": "pollution_slots",
  "spec": ["pollution 4.11", "pollution 8.1", "pollution 8.4", "pollution 11.19", "pollution 11.20"],
  "description": "Test 19: GetPollutionGrid(0..3) returns the air, water and garbage value grids and the radiation SOURCE grid; 4 and above none ([choice]). GetPollutionValue(type, x, z) = max(0, source[type]): a source value -5 reads 0; types 4-7 read the value grids [quirk] (air value 33 at type 4); type 8 reads 0 ([choice]). GetGarbageValue on a landfill cell with raw 0x8064 = signExtend(0x8064) & 0xFFFF7FFF = 0xFFFF0064 = -65,436; IsActiveLandfill there is true; SetGarbageValue(5) keeps bit 15 -> raw 0x8005 -> -65,531. IsAirPolluted compares unsigned against the shipped threshold 512: -1 -> true, 511 -> false, 512 -> true. GetRecyclingCenterEffect returns 0.25 after recyclingEffect = 0.25; GetGarbageProducedLastMonth returns the 64-bit 5,000,000,000; GetGarbageAbductedPrevMonth zero-extends 0xFFFFFFFF. GetGarbageSupply clamps a negative supply to 0 and stores it; AddToGarbageSupply(-10) on 5 returns the applied -5. SetIsActiveLandfill only acts on zone-14 cells whose flag differs (counting active cells). SetIsRadioactive writes 1 / 0 into the radiation source tract. Test 20: a 4 x 4-cell rectangle of garbage 2048 -> average 2048, x k (float32 1/32767, a multiply) = 0.0625019 -> prop curve (0,0)(0.0625,5)(0.125,10) = 5.0001526 -> 5. One active landfill cell (raw 0x8000 -> -65,536) makes the unsigned average huge: (15 x 2048 - 65,536) as u32 / 16 = 268,433,280 -> beyond the curve's last point -> 10 [quirk]. An inverted rectangle returns 0 ([choice]).",
  "steps": [
    {"op": "pollution_create"},
    {"op": "pollution_init"},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "pollution_grid", "args": [0], "expect": "air_val"},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "pollution_grid", "args": [1], "expect": "water_val"},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "pollution_grid", "args": [2], "expect": "garbage_val"},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "pollution_grid", "args": [3], "expect": "rad_src"},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "pollution_grid", "args": [4], "expect": null},
    {"op": "pollution_set_grid", "grid": "air_src", "tracts": [{"x": 5, "z": 5, "v": -5}, {"x": 6, "z": 5, "v": 7}]},
    {"op": "pollution_set_grid", "grid": "air_val", "tracts": [{"x": 5, "z": 5, "v": 33}]},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "pollution_value", "args": [0, 10, 10], "expect": 0},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "pollution_value", "args": [0, 12, 11], "expect": 7},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "pollution_value", "args": [4, 10, 10], "expect": 33},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "pollution_value", "args": [8, 10, 10], "expect": 0},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "air_value", "args": [11, 11], "expect": 33},

    {"op": "pollution_set_grid", "grid": "garbage_val", "cells": [{"x": 30, "z": 30, "v": "0x8064"}]},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "garbage_value", "args": [30, 30], "expect": -65436},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "is_active_landfill", "args": [30, 30], "expect": true},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "is_active_landfill", "args": [31, 30], "expect": false},
    {"op": "pollution_set", "state": {"dirty_garbage": false}},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "set_garbage_value", "args": [30, 30, 5]},
    {"op": "pollution_expect_grid", "grid": "garbage_val", "cells": [{"x": 30, "z": 30, "v": "0x8005"}]},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "garbage_value", "args": [30, 30], "expect": -65531},
    {"op": "pollution_expect", "state": {"dirty_garbage": true}},

    {"op": "pollution_set_grid", "grid": "air_val", "tracts": [{"x": 6, "z": 6, "v": -1}, {"x": 7, "z": 6, "v": 511}, {"x": 8, "z": 6, "v": 512}]},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "is_air_polluted", "args": [12, 12], "expect": true},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "is_air_polluted", "args": [14, 12], "expect": false},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "is_air_polluted", "args": [16, 12], "expect": true},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "set_water_value", "args": [12, 12, 600]},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "is_water_polluted", "args": [13, 13], "expect": true},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "water_value", "args": [13, 13], "expect": 600},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "set_air_value", "args": [20, 20, 9]},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "air_value", "args": [21, 20], "expect": 9},
    {"op": "pollution_expect", "state": {"dirty_air": true, "dirty_water": true}},

    {"op": "pollution_set", "state": {"recycling_effect": 0.25, "last_produced": 5000000000, "decomposed_last_month": 4294967295,
      "last_recycled": 12.75}},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "recycling_center_effect", "expect": 0.25},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "garbage_produced_last_month", "expect": 5000000000},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "garbage_abducted_prev_month", "expect": 4294967295},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "garbage_recycled_last_month", "expect": 12},

    {"op": "pollution_set", "state": {"garbage_supply": -5}},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "garbage_supply", "expect": 0},
    {"op": "pollution_expect", "state": {"garbage_supply": 0}},
    {"op": "pollution_set", "state": {"garbage_supply": 5}},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "add_to_garbage_supply", "args": [-10], "expect": -5},
    {"op": "pollution_expect", "state": {"garbage_supply": 0}},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "set_garbage_capacity", "args": [77], "expect": 77},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "garbage_capacity", "expect": 77},
    {"op": "pollution_set", "state": {"landfilled": 5}},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "garbage_put_in_landfill", "args": [10], "expect": 15},

    {"op": "pollution_env", "zones": [{"x": 40, "z": 40, "zone": 14}]},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "set_is_active_landfill", "args": [41, 40, true]},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "is_active_landfill", "args": [41, 40], "expect": false},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "set_is_active_landfill", "args": [40, 40, true]},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "set_is_active_landfill", "args": [40, 40, true]},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "is_active_landfill", "args": [40, 40], "expect": true},
    {"op": "pollution_expect", "state": {"active_landfill_cells": 1}},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "set_is_active_landfill", "args": [40, 40, false]},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "is_active_landfill", "args": [40, 40], "expect": false},
    {"op": "pollution_expect", "state": {"active_landfill_cells": 0}},

    {"op": "pollution_set", "state": {"dirty_radiation": false}},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "set_is_radioactive", "args": [50, 51, true]},
    {"op": "pollution_expect_grid", "grid": "rad_src", "tracts": [{"x": 25, "z": 25, "v": 1}]},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "is_radioactive", "args": [51, 50], "expect": true},
    {"op": "pollution_expect", "state": {"dirty_radiation": true}},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "set_is_radioactive", "args": [50, 51, false]},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "is_radioactive", "args": [51, 50], "expect": false},

    {"op": "pollution_set_grid", "grid": "garbage_val", "fill": 2048},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "requested_share", "args": [0, 0, 3, 3], "expect": 5},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "is_garbage_accumulated", "args": [0, 0], "expect": true},
    {"op": "pollution_set_grid", "grid": "garbage_val", "cells": [{"x": 3, "z": 3, "v": "0x8000"}]},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "requested_share", "args": [0, 0, 3, 3], "expect": 10},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "requested_share", "args": [3, 3, 0, 0], "expect": 0}
  ]
}
